{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A platformer\u2026 but you can take the platforms with you!? A platformer where a single core mechanic gives rise to diverse and evolving challenges!!!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263880/extras/f433df893f320d681387b4fcd77b46cf.poster.avif?t=1771898657\" width=576 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263880/extras/f433df893f320d681387b4fcd77b46cf.webm?t=1771898657\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263880/extras/f433df893f320d681387b4fcd77b46cf.mp4?t=1771898657\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control DevourSlime and solve clever puzzles by absorbing and shooting out the platforms beneath your feet.Battle corrupted lab machinery and hostile contaminants, stay ahead of the spreading toxic gas, and rescue your trapped companions.Plan your own unique escape route\u2014and find a way out of the laboratory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263880/extras/012474f375d4b13283bc77f42ce2a63e.poster.avif?t=1771898657\" width=576 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263880/extras/012474f375d4b13283bc77f42ce2a63e.webm?t=1771898657\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263880/extras/012474f375d4b13283bc77f42ce2a63e.mp4?t=1771898657\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay Overview</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Project DevourSlime is a precision platformer with puzzle elements, built around <strong>[VERSATILE MECHANICS]</strong>.Use your abilities to <strong>[ABSORD PLATFORMS], [SHOOT THEM OUT]</strong>, and <strong>[DIVE INTO THEM]</strong> to solve puzzles, fight enemies, and perform high-speed platforming challenges.Platforms are a limited resource, requiring careful resource management as you <strong>[plan your own unique and creative routes through each level].</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263880/extras/b213bb61d65e02a0a91542751c4c5d71.poster.avif?t=1771898657\" width=576 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263880/extras/b213bb61d65e02a0a91542751c4c5d71.webm?t=1771898657\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263880/extras/b213bb61d65e02a0a91542751c4c5d71.mp4?t=1771898657\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With stage results and a wide range of achievements, the game challenges you to <strong>[push your limits]</strong>\u2014experimenting with unconventional paths, faster completion times, and more efficient resource usage.\u00a0 \u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story Overview</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DevourSlimes are strange creatures gifted with extraordinary abilities.When scientists uncover the potential of their species, countless DevourSlimes are captured and taken into laboratories for research.Then everything goes wrong.A toxic gas leak spreads through the facility.The scientists flee.You are left behind\u2014seemingly the only surviving DevourSlime.Or are you?As you fight to escape, you begin to realize that the truth behind the laboratory\u2014and your captivity\u2014is far more complex than it first appeared\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263880/extras/ca8298c46aede8f6a9a5f44bbd031202.avif?t=1771898657\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263880/extras_big/ca8298c46aede8f6a9a5f44bbd031202.webp?t=1771898657 width=1560 height=872 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3263880?t=1771898657","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263880/5ce652986a7064a4caa75bd7d7b78d9a923e616f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771898657","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263880/007fd330d19d7cb646406ec0534a9ba7d9f5c3be/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771898657","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263880/007fd330d19d7cb646406ec0534a9ba7d9f5c3be/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771898657","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4256510,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A platformer\u2026 but you can take the platforms with you!? A platformer where a single core mechanic gives rise to diverse and evolving challenges!!!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263880/extras/f433df893f320d681387b4fcd77b46cf.poster.avif?t=1771898657\" width=576 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263880/extras/f433df893f320d681387b4fcd77b46cf.webm?t=1771898657\" type=\"video/webm; codec