80/extras/b213bb61d65e02a0a91542751c4c5d71.poster.avif?t=1771898657\" width=576 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263880/extras/b213bb61d65e02a0a91542751c4c5d71.webm?t=1771898657\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263880/extras/b213bb61d65e02a0a91542751c4c5d71.mp4?t=1771898657\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With stage results and a wide range of achievements, the game challenges you to <strong>[push your limits]</strong>\u2014experimenting with unconventional paths, faster completion times, and more efficient resource usage.\u00a0 \u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story Overview</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DevourSlimes are strange creatures gifted with extraordinary abilities.When scientists uncover the potential of their species, countless DevourSlimes are captured and taken into laboratories for research.Then everything goes wrong.A toxic gas leak spreads through the facility.The scientists flee.You are left behind\u2014seemingly the only surviving DevourSlime.Or are you?As you fight to escape, you begin to realize that the truth behind the laboratory\u2014and your captivity\u2014is far more complex than it first appeared\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263880/extras/ca8298c46aede8f6a9a5f44bbd031202.avif?t=1771898657\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263880/extras_big/ca8298c46aede8f6a9a5f44bbd031202.webp?t=1771898657 width=1560 height=872 /></span></p>","developers":["StrangeWave Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263880/200a10bc10a8c9740e7b868476c9252d8c282e69/hea